WEBVTT

NOTE
The Lunar Cry — the moon streams monsters down to the planet.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 6 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Amid magenta energy, the cratered moon fills the view.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:21.320
It pours a vast red river of monsters and debris off its surface.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.800
The stream rains down through space.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:43.280
It falls onto the cloud-wrapped planet below.
